@@ -167,3 +167,18 @@ point (Billing, status chip, ready screen) opens the one free-tier sign-in dialo
 from the onboarding picker that moved apps shows the same result screen once onboarding leaves the
 screen (onboarding paints above every dialog). Never branch on
 provider display names: the picker row carries `free_tier_row`, status cards carry `free_tier`.
+
+### Scoped composer plugins
+
+`usePluginComposerContext()` is available only inside a composer contribution and
+returns its own stored session, connection, profile and visibility, not window
+focus. Drafts and unresolved owners return `null`; inactive or historical views
+set `visible: false`. Plugins must not substitute a global focused owner.
+
+Feature-detect `PLUGIN_REST_OWNER_SUPPORTED === true` before using
+`ctx.rest(path, { owner: { connectionId, profile } })`. Explicit incomplete owners
+are rejected; omitted owners retain legacy active-route behavior. An explicit
+owner pins both reads and writes even when another gateway becomes active.
+This is routing, not authorization: the plugin backend must still validate its
+configured destination and user decision. These generic APIs do not submit a
+message or start an agent turn.
